---
import Section from "./ui/Section.astro";
import Container from "./ui/Container.astro";
import Card from "./ui/Card.astro";
---

<Section id="problem-solution">
  <Container class="opacity-0 translate-y-5 transition duration-500 [will-change:transform,opacity]" data-reveal>
    <div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
      <Card class="p-6">
        <h2 class="m-0 text-h2">The Problem</h2>
        <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-body text-[color:var(--text-muted)]">
          <li>Hard breakpoints cause sudden jumps in readability.</li>
          <li>Responsive type rules sprawl across multiple media queries.</li>
          <li>Mixing semantic tags and utility sizes creates design drift.</li>
          <li>Teams struggle to keep hierarchy consistent across pages.</li>
        </ul>
      </Card>

      <Card class="p-6">
        <h2 class="m-0 text-h2">The Solution</h2>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-body text-[color:var(--text-muted)]">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="mt-2 size-[0.7rem] rounded-full bg-[color:var(--accent)]" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            Smooth continuous scaling from 360px to desktop widescreen.
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="mt-2 size-[0.7rem] rounded-full bg-[color:var(--accent)]" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span>Semantic classes like <code class="font-['IBM_Plex_Mono']">.text-h2</code> on any element.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="mt-2 size-[0.7rem] rounded-full bg-[color:var(--accent)]" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            Six variables control your entire type system.
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="mt-2 size-[0.7rem] rounded-full bg-[color:var(--accent)]" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            Pure CSS clamp-based logic with no runtime dependency.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </Card>
    </div>
  </Container>
</Section>
